{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:0.3"], "en": "Perfection of Loving-kindness (Mettāpāramī) 1", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:0.4"], "en": "The Conduct of Suvaṇṇasāma:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:1.1"], "en": "“When I was Sāma in the forest,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:1.2"], "en": "created by Sakka;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:1.3", "PA_cp_33:1.4"], "en": "In the forest, I directed loving-kindness toward lions and tigers;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:2.1"], "en": "toward lions, tigers, and leopards, I extended it.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:2.2"], "en": "Surrounded by excellent buffaloes,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:2.3"], "en": "deer, and wild boars,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:2.4"], "en": "I lived in the forest.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:3.1"], "en": "No one terrifies me,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:3.2"], "en": "nor do I fear anyone;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:3.3"], "en": "established in the power of loving-kindness, I am steadfast.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:3.4"], "en": "\"I delight in the wind then.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_33:4.1"], "en": "This is the thirteenth chapter, the Story of Suvaṇṇasāma.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
